# Article and post artwork. It is committed because published writing links to
# it by raw URL, but it is not part of the package, so it stays out of the
# archive. This file sits in doc/ rather than the repository root on purpose:
# pub replaces .gitignore with .pubignore *per directory*, so a root .pubignore
# would silence the root .gitignore for the whole tree and ship build/ output.
blog/
